  "version": "2.8.0",
  "notes": "Crysta 2.8.0 focuses on keeping your writing safe and making book exports complete.\r\n\r\nYOUR WRITING IS SAFER\r\n- Edits are no longer lost when you switch chapters, steps or tabs quickly, close the project, or close the window.\r\n- Text no longer jumps back while you are typing during a save.\r\n- Restoring a snapshot now shows the restored version right away. Crysta first saves your current state as a snapshot, so a restore can be undone.\r\n- Opening a project that was moved or deleted now says the file can't be found, instead of creating an empty project in its place. The project stays in your recent list.\r\n- Only the 10 most recent automatic snapshots are kept. Manual snapshots are never deleted.\r\n\r\nCOMPLETE BOOK EXPORTS\r\n- EPUB, Word and PDF exports now include every chapter, including ones written in the current session.\r\n- Every line you write is its own paragraph.\r\n- New formatting in the chapter editor: *italic*, **bold**, and *** on its own line for a scene break.\r\n- Word exports now include the title, copyright, dedication, epigraph, foreword, epilogue, acknowledgments and about-the-author pages, a table of contents, page numbers and real chapter headings.\r\n- New Book Studio options: book language (sets right-to-left or left-to-right), print page size, chapter numbering, scene break symbol, table of contents and acknowledgments.\r\n- Chapter headings now show the chapter number above the title. Choose \"Title only\" under Typography & Layout to keep the old look.\r\n- PDF exports use your chosen font even when you are offline.\r\n\r\nEASIER TO USE\r\n- Novel details on the dashboard save automatically.\r\n- Step 10 can save your whole outline as a Markdown file.\r\n- Zen mode remembers its theme, width and text size, and goes fullscreen.\r\n- The command palette (Ctrl+K) can toggle Zen mode and the reference panel, and take a snapshot.\r\n- Fonts are built into the app, so it looks the same offline, and dark mode no longer flashes white on startup.\r\n- Clearer error messages, better keyboard navigation in dialogs, and every label translated into Arabic and English.\r\n\r\nGOOD TO KNOW\r\n- Your projects are upgraded automatically the first time you open them in 2.8.0.\r\n- Exporting files on Android isn't supported yet; the app now tells you instead of doing nothing.",
